      "why": "Q-D7 RULED 2026-08-18 (reverses W-7): mark-done writes actual_time = planned_time, NOT now — the confirmation says it happened as planned; planned_time immutable; display actual ?? planned. Regenerated from the v2 (staged) spec; @v2's ratified expected was actual 900 / display 900"
    },
    {
      "id": "two-time-mark-done-after-planned",
      "status": "ratified",
      "inputs": {
        "plannedTimeMin": 1050,
        "gesture": "mark_done",
        "nowMin": 1200
      },
      "expected": {
        "actualTimeMin": 1050,
        "plannedTimeMin": 1050,
        "displayTimeMin": 1050
      },
      "why": "Q-D7: a swipe made hours AFTER the session does not relocate it either — nowMin is not an input to the write (both sides of the now-vs-planned boundary pinned; the day of the card is likewise irrelevant to the write, so the past-day case is this same vector)"
    },
