      "expected": {
        "actualTimeMin": 1042,
        "plannedTimeMin": 1050,
        "source": "GARMIN",
        "displayTimeMin": 1042
      },
      "why": "Unchanged by Q-D7 and pinned so nobody infers otherwise: a later Garmin sync overwrites a mark-done actual_time with the measured start (MANUAL -> GARMIN, same as the kcal path); planned_time untouched"
    },
